            "Because natural systems depend on openings, anything that reduces an opening reduces performance. Restrictors, mesh, debris, seized hinges and blocked inlets all matter. The survey looks for each one.",
            "Natural systems still need power for detection, control and actuation. Standby batteries, panels and actuators are tested just as they would be on any AOV system.",
